# Files and directories excluded from the distributable zip.
#
# Everything here is development or repository scaffolding. The zip must contain
# the plugin and its production dependencies only: shipping the dev tooling
# would put PHPUnit and PHPCS on every site that installs it.

.git
.github
.gitignore
.distignore
.editorconfig
.claude
.wp-env.json
.phpunit.result.cache

bin
build
dev
docs
tests

# Any archive lying about in the working copy. build/ is excluded above, but a
# zip that has found its way to the root is not the plugin, and packaging one
# inside the plugin doubles the download for no reason. This happened: a stray
# copy of the previous release was ignored by .gitignore, so it never showed up
# in git status, and shipped inside the next build.
*.zip
node_modules

phpcs.xml.dist
phpunit.xml.dist
CLAUDE.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
DECISIONS.md
CODEX-REVIEW.md
CODEX-REVIEW-RESPONSE.md

# WSL writes these alongside files copied from Windows.
*:Zone.Identifier
